            new Topic("Arrange windows", "move my window|move a window|move windows|snap my window|snap a window|snap windows|maximize a window|maximise a window|maximize my window|resize my window|resize a window|window to my other monitor|window to another monitor|windows between monitors|arrange my windows|arrange windows",
                "Ask her to maximize, restore, snap to the left, right, top or bottom half, move to another monitor, move to a corner or the middle, or resize an app's window, or keep it on top of your other windows, like snap Discord to the left, maximize Chrome, send Spotify to my other monitor or keep Discord on top, until unpin Discord. Monitors are named left to right: the main screen, screen 2 and screen 3, and a portrait one answers to portrait. She says where it ended up, like an app that won't go any smaller. Windows running as admin, like Task Manager, only move when Capri runs as admin too. Mainframe > Settings > HABITS > Security > Close and switch apps and tabs sets whether she asks first. It's Windows only for now.", "Hands.cs", "app_window"),
